        "a": "The free tool is a quick single draft. Proposal Studio adds the grant, ethics and data plan forms, lets you write one section at a time, choose sources and filters, attach your own files or Library papers, pick a citation style and build on an earlier Deep Research result. Everything is saved to History and opens in the editor."
