        "q": "What is the best Elicit alternative?",
        "a": "It depends on what you need from Elicit. For quick yes-or-no evidence questions, Consensus is a close alternative. For research that has to become a thesis chapter, proposal or reviewed manuscript, AI for Research adds an editor with live citations, a Reviewer and Thesis Suite. For screening thousands of papers with heavy extraction, Elicit itself remains the stronger choice."
