        "a": "Yes, with limits. As checked on its pricing page in November 2026, the free plan includes basic search, up to 20 inputs, 100 articles per map and a monthly summary of new papers; the page lists one or two maps in different places. Pro costs $10 a month, or $120 a year with an academic email, and removes the input, article and map limits."
