        "a": "No. It does not show the sentences in which other papers cite a study, and it does not classify citations as supporting or contrasting. For that, use scite or read the citing papers yourself. AI for Research covers the checks on your own draft: claims against papers, references against Crossref and OpenAlex, and the sentences that cite each source."
