        "a": "There is no file to download. Copy the 12-slide template on this page into PowerPoint, Keynote or Google Slides, using your university's slide master if it has one. Or upload your thesis to Slides with the Thesis defence preset, which builds a deck with speaker notes and a references slide and downloads as PowerPoint on paid plans."
